About neutron-test-midlet

  This project tests some Neutron using <<{{{http://snapshot.pyx4me.com/pyx4me-cldcunit/}CLDCUnit}}>> J2ME JUnit base test framework.

  J2ME application distributon {{neutron-test-midlet-#version#-test.jad}} and {{neutron-test-midlet-#version#-test.jar}} has two MIDLets.

    *  MainTest is used to execute tests manualy during .

    *  UnitTests is used to execute JUnit tests.

  See the {{{source-repository.html}sources}} for this project.

* Try this MIDlet

   Start Neutron Web Start {{{/neutron-webstart/open-local/~/neutron-tests/neutron-test-midlet/neutron-test-midlet-#version#-test.jnlp}neutron-test-midlet-#version#-test}}